{"id":57499,"date":"2026-08-07T10:35:56","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T09:35:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57499"},"modified":"2026-10-01T11:15:40","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T10:15:40","slug":"iron-loop-mira","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/iron-loop-mira\/","title":{"rendered":"Iron Loop \u2013 Mira 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Iron Loop \u2013 Mira 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Iron Loop 3070 \u2013 Mira 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>03 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, tendo como cen\u00e1rio id\u00edlico a zona da <strong>Praia Fluvial da Praia de Mira<\/strong>, no distrito de Coimbra. Um formato inovador de ultra resist\u00eancia e estrat\u00e9gia por equipas de revezamento.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com in\u00edcio marcado para as 09h00, o desafio coloca <strong>equipas de 3 atletas<\/strong> a percorrerem um total de <strong>80 km ao longo de 8 horas consecutivas<\/strong>. A cada hora, a equipa tem de completar uma ronda de 10,2 km (3 voltas ao circuito de 3,4 km), com passagem obrigat\u00f3ria de testemunho na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o e elimina\u00e7\u00e3o direta para quem n\u00e3o terminar dentro do tempo limite.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>FitMe 3070<\/strong>, garantindo cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica cont\u00ednua com tempos individuais acumulados por chip, sinaliza\u00e7\u00e3o rigorosa, balne\u00e1rios de apoio no Parque de Campismo Municipal e medalhas de finalista para todas as equipas que resistam at\u00e9 ao fim.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Praia Fluvial da Praia de Mira, Coimbra<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Resist\u00eancia por Equipas 80 km (8 horas \/ Revezamento)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">FitMe 3070<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8h00 (1 hora por ronda de 10,2 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/waitastart.com\/regulamentos\/reg_ironloop2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/><\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estafeta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Iron Loop 80 km (Equipas de 3)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 03 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 Plano (Circuito 3,4 km)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico:<\/strong> 60.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 ao limite de vagas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Iron Loop \u2013 Mira 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 03 de Outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h00 na zona da praia fluvial da Praia de Mira, concelho de Mira, Coimbra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o formato de prova de 80 km em 8 horas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Equipas de 3 atletas t\u00eam de completar 8 rondas de 10,2 km (1 ronda por hora). Cada ronda s\u00e3o 3 voltas ao circuito de 3,4 km. A gest\u00e3o de voltas entre atletas \u00e9 livre, mas a troca s\u00f3 ocorre na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o com testemunho.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que acontece se uma equipa n\u00e3o cumprir a ronda numa hora?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Se a equipa n\u00e3o concluir a ronda de 10,2 km dentro do limite rigoroso de 1 hora, \u00e9 automaticamente desclassificada da competi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial completo em PDF do FitMe 3070 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download na ficha t\u00e9cnica do evento no portal Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da equipa?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A taxa de 60\u20ac por equipa de 3 inclui participa\u00e7\u00e3o nas 8 horas, seguro desportivo de acidentes pessoais, dorsais com chip, pack de \u00e1guas de partida e medalhas de finalista.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Iron Loop \u2013 Mira 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mira, Coimbra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mira, Coimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Mira, Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Iron Loop \u2013 Mira 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 03 de Outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09h00 na zona da praia fluvial da Praia de Mira, concelho de Mira, Coimbra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o formato de prova de 80 km em 8 horas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Equipas de 3 atletas t\u00eam de completar 8 rondas de 10,2 km (1 ronda por hora). Cada ronda s\u00e3o 3 voltas ao circuito de 3,4 km. A gest\u00e3o de voltas entre atletas \u00e9 livre, mas a troca s\u00f3 ocorre na zona de transi\u00e7\u00e3o com testemunho.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que acontece se uma equipa n\u00e3o cumprir a ronda numa hora?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Se a equipa n\u00e3o concluir a ronda de 10,2 km dentro do limite rigoroso de 1 hora, \u00e9 automaticamente desclassificada da competi\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento oficial completo em PDF do FitMe 3070 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel para consulta e download na ficha t\u00e9cnica do evento no portal Portugal Running.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da equipa?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A taxa de 60\u20ac por equipa de 3 inclui participa\u00e7\u00e3o nas 8 horas, seguro desportivo de acidentes pessoais, dorsais com chip, pack de \u00e1guas de partida e medalhas de finalista.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67886,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,681],"event_type_2":[37,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57499","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mira-coimbra","event_type-corrida","event_type-outras","event_type_2-coimbra","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centr